I always tell lies He smiled What do you mean?

00:20:37.162 --> 00:20:38.983
That's the truth.

00:20:39.043 --> 00:20:45.602
I always tell lies Is line telling the truth?

00:20:45.662 --> 00:20:47.938
or is he lying?

00:20:47.998 --> 00:21:17.897
Chapter 4 Tuesday, an important meeting.

00:21:17.957 --> 00:21:21.118
There was a hotel near the laboratory.

00:21:21.178 --> 00:21:23.548
Mrs. Seeker was staying there.

00:21:23.608 --> 00:21:27.730
Inspector Sack and Dr. Simple were staying there too.

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:33.961
Mrs. Seeker, Inspector Sack and Dr. Simple were eating breakfast together.

00:21:34.021 --> 00:21:37.032
I know the truth about my husband.

00:21:37.092 --> 00:21:41.616
Now I am very unhappy, said Mrs. Seeker.

00:21:41.676 --> 00:21:45.140
I know the truth about my criminals.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:49.812
Now I haven't got a job," said Inspector Sack.

00:21:49.872 --> 00:21:53.004
I know the truth about my spy.

00:21:53.064 --> 00:21:56.916
What shall I do now, said Dr. Simple?

00:21:56.976 --> 00:21:59.668
Mrs. Seeker was crying.

00:21:59.728 --> 00:22:03.570
I don't like the truth, machine," she said.

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:07.572
Inspector Sack and Dr. Simple agreed with her.

00:22:07.632 --> 00:22:11.080
Inspector Sack shouted in a loud voice.

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:14.748
We paid the professor a lot of money.

00:22:14.808 --> 00:22:19.890
He said, Mrs. Seeker and Dr. Simple agreed with him.

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:23.801
Dr. Simple spoke quietly and slowly.

00:22:23.861 --> 00:22:27.502
Professor Verity is a criminal.

00:22:27.562 --> 00:22:33.034
He said, Mrs. Seeker and Inspector Sack agreed with him.

00:22:33.094 --> 00:22:39.448
I'm going to say Professor Verity said, Mrs. Seeker, I shall come with you.

00:22:39.508 --> 00:22:41.652
shouted Inspector Sack.

00:22:41.712 --> 00:22:46.474
A good idea, said Dr. Simple slowly.

00:22:46.534 --> 00:22:48.946
I shall come too.

00:22:49.006 --> 00:22:54.368
Mrs. Seeker, Inspector Sack and Dr. Simple left the hotel.

00:22:54.428 --> 00:22:57.070
They wanted to see Professor Verity.

00:22:57.130 --> 00:23:05.624
They went to the laboratory.

00:23:05.684 --> 00:23:16.569
Chapter Five, at the laboratory again.

00:23:16.629 --> 00:23:24.231
Soon Mrs. Seeker, Inspector Sack, and Dr. Simple were at the laboratory.

00:23:24.251 --> 00:23:26.772
"'I hate you, Professor Verity!"

00:23:26.832 --> 00:23:28.612
cried Mrs. Seeker.

00:23:28.673 --> 00:23:33.094
"'I want my money back, Professor," shouted Inspector Sack.

00:23:33.114 --> 00:23:37.975
"'You're a criminal, Verity," said Dr. Simple.

00:23:38.035 --> 00:23:42.234
Professor Verity looked at his first three clients.

00:23:42.294 --> 00:23:45.003
Fools," he said.

00:23:45.063 --> 00:23:47.014
You are fools.

00:23:47.074 --> 00:23:48.704
You wanted the truth.

00:23:48.764 --> 00:23:50.365
I gave you the truth.

00:23:50.425 --> 00:23:53.536
The truth machine gave you the truth.

00:23:53.596 --> 00:23:54.776
Truth?

00:23:54.836 --> 00:23:56.177
said Mrs. Seeker.

00:23:56.237 --> 00:23:58.058
But now I am unhappy.

00:23:58.078 --> 00:23:59.928
Thrills?

00:23:59.988 --> 00:24:01.739
shouted Inspector Sack.

00:24:01.799 --> 00:24:04.810
But now I haven't got a job.

00:24:04.870 --> 00:24:06.351
Truth?

00:24:06.411 --> 00:24:07.891
Said Dr. Simple.

00:24:07.951 --> 00:24:10.214
But what is the truth?

00:24:10.274 --> 00:24:12.397
What is the truth?"

00:24:12.457 --> 00:24:14.168
said Professor Verity.

00:24:14.228 --> 00:24:15.878
Let me tell you.

00:24:15.938 --> 00:24:20.079
Mrs. Seeker, you hate lies and I gave you the truth.

00:24:20.139 --> 00:24:22.279
Your husband loves anelyate.

00:24:22.339 --> 00:24:23.810
That is the truth.

00:24:23.870 --> 00:24:26.590
Inspector, the Professor went on.

00:24:26.650 --> 00:24:28.251
You hate crime.

00:24:28.311 --> 00:24:30.501
I put your criminals in prison.

00:24:30.561 --> 00:24:32.271
That is the truth.

00:24:32.332 --> 00:24:34.712
Simple, said the Professor.

00:24:34.772 --> 00:24:36.552
You fight for peace.

00:24:36.612 --> 00:24:37.843
I helped you.

00:24:37.903 --> 00:24:40.022
That is the truth.

00:24:40.082 --> 00:24:42.183
The professor stopped.

00:24:42.242 --> 00:24:43.493
Then he spoke again.

00:24:43.513 --> 00:24:46.396
"'Fools,' he said.

00:24:46.416 --> 00:24:47.937
"'Go home.'

00:24:47.957 --> 00:24:52.621
"'Do you really hate lies, Professor Verity?'

00:24:52.681 --> 00:24:53.942
asked Mrs. Seeker.

00:24:53.962 --> 00:24:57.866
"'Do you really hate crime, Professor?'

00:24:57.926 --> 00:24:59.427
shouted Inspector Sack.

00:24:59.447 --> 00:25:02.489
"'And do you really fight for peace?'

00:25:02.549 --> 00:25:04.260
asked Dr. Simple.

00:25:04.320 --> 00:25:08.114
"'Yes, yes, yes,' cried Professor Verity.

00:25:08.134 --> 00:25:10.139
"'That's the truth.

00:25:10.199 --> 00:25:12.974
Then Dr. Simple spoke.

00:25:13.034 --> 00:25:16.405
We shall see, he said.

00:25:16.465 --> 00:25:22.147
Professor Verity will be the truth speaker.

00:25:22.207 --> 00:25:27.588
Why did you invent the truth machine?

00:25:27.648 --> 00:25:29.399
Success.

00:25:29.459 --> 00:25:31.460
I want success.

00:25:31.520 --> 00:25:34.711
What do you really want?

00:25:34.771 --> 00:25:36.362
Money.

00:25:36.422 --> 00:25:38.234
I want money.

00:25:38.294 --> 00:25:41.548
What do you really want?

00:25:41.608 --> 00:25:43.230
Power.

00:25:43.290 --> 00:25:45.092
I want power.

00:25:45.152 --> 00:25:48.244
You don't hate lies, Professor Verity.

00:25:48.304 --> 00:25:49.994
You want success?

00:25:50.054 --> 00:25:51.946
Said Mrs. Seeker.

00:25:52.006 --> 00:25:54.988
You don't hate crime, Professor.

00:25:55.048 --> 00:25:56.620
You want money.

00:25:56.680 --> 00:25:58.631
Shouted Inspector Sack.

00:25:58.691 --> 00:26:01.072
You don't want peace, Verity.

00:26:01.133 --> 00:26:02.704
You want power?

00:26:02.764 --> 00:26:04.395
Said Dr. Simple.

00:26:04.455 --> 00:26:05.586
Yes.

00:26:05.646 --> 00:26:07.586
Laugh, Professor Verity.

00:26:07.646 --> 00:26:09.386
You fools.

00:26:09.446 --> 00:26:11.477
You gave me success.

00:26:11.537 --> 00:26:13.478
You gave me money.

00:26:13.538 --> 00:26:15.569
You gave me power.

00:26:15.629 --> 00:26:20.001
Now I am successful, rich and powerful.

00:26:20.061 --> 00:26:24.743
And that is the truth.

00:26:24.803 --> 00:26:29.255
Everybody was quiet.

00:26:29.315 --> 00:26:32.126
Then Inspector Sack took out his gun.

00:26:32.186 --> 00:26:34.178
Mrs. Seeker screamed.

00:26:34.238 --> 00:26:37.544
Inspector Sack shot Professor Verity.

00:26:37.604 --> 00:26:54.260
and Dr. Simple destroyed the truth machine.

